{"id":"db792a94ed0c1bf3","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-finite-basis-consequence.md","title":"thm-finite-basis-consequence","display":"thm-finite-basis-consequence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-finite-subset]]"],"display":"thm-finite-basis-consequence","label":"93-thm-finite-basis-consequence","aliases":["93-thm-finite-basis-consequence"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-basis-consequence"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-finite-basis-consequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-finite-basis-consequence</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-finite-basis-consequence-thm-finite-basis-consequence\">thm-finite-basis-consequence <code>thm-finite-basis-consequence</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is the formula carrier of the displayed logic and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq F\">\\(T\\subseteq F\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in F\">\\(\\varphi\\in F\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([T]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}basis\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\\land T\\subseteq F\\land\\varphi\\in F\\land T\\vdash\\varphi\n\\to\\exists T_0\\in[T]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(T_0\\vdash\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}basis\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\\land T\\subseteq F\\land\\varphi\\in F\\land T\\vdash\\varphi\n\\to\\exists T_0\\in[T]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(T_0\\vdash\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Finitarity gives a finite basis for each individual consequence.  It does not imply that the entire theory <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is finitely axiomatizable.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-finite-basis-consequence-thm-finite-basis-consequence","text":"thm-finite-basis-consequence `thm-finite-basis-consequence`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq F$, $\\varphi\\in F$, and $[T]^{<\\omega}$ is from [[93-df-finite-subset]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq F","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"[T]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}basis\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash)\\land T\\subseteq F\\land\\varphi\\in F\\land T\\vdash\\varphi\n\\to\\exists T_0\\in[T]^{<\\omega}\\;(T_0\\vdash\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":873,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["bd7e4207897c8db3","6b63f2f43b5511ee"]}